      en: ["The caldera is located at the 2,361-meter summit of Mount Karthala.", "With dimensions of 3 x 4 km, it is one of the most extensive calderas worldwide.", "The volcano erupts on average every 11 years.", "The 2005 eruption created a temporary crater lake within the caldera.", "Over 20 historical eruptions have been documented since the 19th century.", "The caldera hosts fumaroles that continuously emit volcanic gases."],
